WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:09.170
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:39.990
Chinese Spring Festival is in the lunar January.

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:42.470
In this busiest time of a year,

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:45.070
the biggest event for cooks in Guangzhou,

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:47.590
(Guangzhou Dumpling Competition)
Guangzhou Dumpling Competition starts.

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:51.000
Our Yang Spring Restaurant

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:52.970
was gonna chase for the championship

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:54.420
with Chef Zhou Yu's special dish,

00:01:54.470 --> 00:01:55.480
Phoenix and Jade Dumpling.

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:57.860
But someone unexpected came up,

00:01:58.210 --> 00:01:59.590
Stray Cooks, Dumpling Brothers.

00:02:00.230 --> 00:02:01.400
They will do whatever it takes
to win the competition.

00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:03.270
They are serious rivals.

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:09.560
Shabby Tricks

00:02:09.820 --> 00:02:11.250
Mao at the End of His Rope

00:02:22.710 --> 00:02:25.390
I can't believe it becomes Fire Dumplings.

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:29.180
Alright.

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:31.360
Our Fire Dumplings are done.

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:36.500
Come on!

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:37.430
Just have a try.

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:38.680
I promise they must be tasty.

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:39.900
Give me a plate of dumplings.

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:41.100
I'm getting one too!

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:42.820
That's great!

00:02:43.370 --> 00:02:44.250
I have never

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:45.100
had better dumplings.

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:47.300
As befits the Dumpling Brothers.

00:02:47.550 --> 00:02:49.440
Really? I'll have the same.

00:02:49.670 --> 00:02:50.590
So will I.

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:51.720
Give me one.

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:55.120
Don't push.

00:02:55.170 --> 00:02:56.140
Don't push!

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:57.020
Go away. Go away.

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:58.640
Don't push!

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:00.580
Miss from Yang Spring Restaurant,

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:02.050
do you go here for some news?

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:03.810
Here you are.

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:05.950
After tasting our dumplings,

00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:06.820
maybe you'll

00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:08.970
be convinced.

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:11.450
It's just a trick.

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:13.070
I'm not that stupid.

00:03:14.410 --> 00:03:15.630
Please.

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:23.890
Well, how does it taste?

00:03:28.330 --> 00:03:28.760
Miss,

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:30.770
I'll send you some later.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:36.800
It's not only a trick.

00:03:38.370 --> 00:03:39.210
The wrapper and filling

00:03:39.350 --> 00:03:40.270
were kneaded well

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:42.020
by that strongman.

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:43.490
And extra water

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:45.600
was evaporated by fire.

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:47.870
So the dumplings taste crispy.

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:50.040
They are worthy competitors.

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:51.060
We can only count on Mao.

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:52.590
Is that OK?

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:54.740
It's a dumpling competition.

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:57.080
While he has been making soup

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:59.270
and that since yesterday.

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:10.110
Obviously,

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:12.200
everyone is gathering

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:13.930
in the front of Dumpling Brother's stall,
which appears for the first time.

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:15.010
People are scrambling

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:16.950
for their Fire Dumplings.

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:20.170
They are really street cooks
who have ever toured around the country.

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:21.860
They are attracting guests in such a special way.

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:26.530
Elder Guan, how does it taste?

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:28.370
The Fire Dumpling.

00:04:31.990 --> 00:04:33.480
I haven't thought there would be someone

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:34.520
who can cook dumplings in this way.

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:38.380
We must take Dumpling Brothers seriously.

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:41.860
Come on, help yourself.

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:44.590
Already lots of plates there.

00:04:45.190 --> 00:04:45.680
Mao,

00:04:45.730 --> 00:04:47.750
are the dumplings ready?

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:49.900
I'm going to fry them.

00:04:52.340 --> 00:04:54.630
Time goes on.

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:55.660
Who will

00:04:55.710 --> 00:04:56.510
win the competition?

00:04:57.110 --> 00:04:59.010
Comb Dumplings from Taotao Garden,

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:01.100
Shrimp Steamed Dumplings from Beiyuan Restaurant,

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:03.310
or the dumplings from Guangzhou
Dumpling Restaurant, the champion last year?

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:04.020
That's odd.

00:05:04.550 --> 00:05:05.590
Anyway,

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:08.110
the most eye-catching this year is Dumpling Brothers.

00:05:08.390 --> 00:05:10.770
Who can beat them?

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:14.630
Well, I'm done.

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:15.590
Really?

00:05:16.090 --> 00:05:17.660
They smell nice.

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:18.870
Let's have a taste.

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:22.890
I worried a lot.

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:24.580
I'm afraid of accidents.

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:27.420
The competition is just beginning.

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:32.280
What is it? It's pretty terrible.

00:05:32.420 --> 00:05:33.450
That's true.

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:34.600
It's hardly eatable.

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:36.090
What? How could it be?

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:43.420
Why?

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:44.210
Here it is.

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:53.750
No, it's not my sauce.

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:55.330
Mao, what happened?

00:05:55.650 --> 00:05:56.320
I don't know.

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:58.740
I won't make this kind of sauce.

00:06:04.140 --> 00:06:05.960
It must be their tricks.

00:06:06.350 --> 00:06:08.150
I've had enough.

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:09.950
I'll report them.

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:10.890
Yeah.

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:12.220
It's they who make our chief injured.

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:13.870
Miss, I'll go with you.

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:14.620
So will I.

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:16.580
Don't go there. We have no proof.

00:06:18.220 --> 00:06:20.550
We're doomed. We'll lose.

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:23.700
Such loathsome men!

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:29.170
We still have time.

00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:35.820
I'll remake it right now.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:38.900
Whoever did this, leave it alone.

00:06:39.470 --> 00:06:41.480
With my self-esteem as a cook,

00:06:42.570 --> 00:06:44.970
I just need to try my best and see
who will be the winner.

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:02.240
Let's do everything we can

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:03.490
to help Mao.

00:07:04.280 --> 00:07:04.990
All right.

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:24.770
Sunset is close,

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:25.870
and the competition is nearly up.

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:28.280
Now Dumpling Brothers' Fire Dumplings

00:07:28.360 --> 00:07:30.260
are still getting more empty plates steadily.

00:07:30.940 --> 00:07:32.110
Everything is going well.

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:32.940
Yes.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:35.280
That's not even close.

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:37.040
It's impossible for them to catch up with us.

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:39.340
Things are easier than I imagined.

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:41.830
What is this old man going to do?

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:47.580
It's pretty lively here.

00:07:48.140 --> 00:07:49.110
Let me see.

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:55.030
It's awesome.

00:07:55.170 --> 00:07:57.180
I'll have one.

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:04.320
It's nice. I'll have one more.

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:09.850
You disturbed me, old man.

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:12.140
You're so smelly that

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:13.970
nobody dares come to our stall.

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:15.450
If you are hungry,

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:16.690
just go to find something to eat somewhere else.

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:19.210
Just go!

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:20.670
Did you hear me, old man?

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:21.700
Go!

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:24.240
Although it tastes good,

00:08:24.550 --> 00:08:25.660
it's a pity.

00:08:28.390 --> 00:08:30.460
What smells so delicious?

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:32.570
(Yang Spring Restaurant)
Welcome to our stall.

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:34.220
(Yang Spring Restaurant)
It's fried dumpling

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:36.610
specially made by the talented cook Mao,

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:39.400
the pride of the most famous Guangzhou
restaurant, Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:08:40.110 --> 00:08:40.980
It seems that it doesn't work.

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:42.580
People give up

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:43.570
Yang Spring Restaurant

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:45.470
because Chef Zhou Yu is injured.

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:52.120
You don't let me down,

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:52.490
Mao.

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:53.690
Chef Zhou Yu.

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:55.620
Can I have a taste?

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:57.020
Welcome to our stall.

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:02.620
You can eat it directly without sauce.

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:04.250
Without sauce?

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:05.250
Yes.

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:07.840
It's different from others.

00:09:07.890 --> 00:09:09.850
They look simple,

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:12.570
but they also look delicious.

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:28.940
This is,

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:33.700
I know,

00:09:34.250 --> 00:09:37.130
the secret of the aroma I smelt before.

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:42.100
You replaced water with stock, right?

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:45.670
Yes, you're right.

00:09:46.090 --> 00:09:48.240
I want the wrapper to be delicious either.

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:50.160
So I shattered pig bones to make stock

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:52.040
and used it in substitution for water.

00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:53.620
Aroma came out

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:55.980
when the stock charred.

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:57.620
If it's true,

00:09:57.670 --> 00:09:58.810
I don't need the sauce.

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:00.750
When the stock permeates into the skin,

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:03.260
making it charred properly can add the flavour.

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:05.270
But it goes beyond that.

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:07.590
It doesn't taste greasy.

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:10.770
The skin eats refreshing.

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:13.180
You used that, right?

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:14.910
What is that, Mao?

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:16.380
I used...

00:10:17.020 --> 00:10:17.730
Yams.

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:18.980
Yes, it is.

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:21.400
Exactly.

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:23.310
He's right again.

00:10:23.670 --> 00:10:24.700
Who is this old man?

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:26.510
Well, I'll have one more.

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:28.970
Nice.

00:10:30.800 --> 00:10:33.240
Each one tastes different,

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:34.790
and feels different.

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:37.510
The filling tastes soft as if it's going to melt.

00:10:37.910 --> 00:10:41.770
Each time I bite, my mouth is filled with fresh gravy.

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:44.990
Spicy flavour

00:10:45.180 --> 00:10:46.660
stimulates my tongue slightly.

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:48.700
The secret is that,

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:49.610
right?

00:10:51.140 --> 00:10:51.810
Mao.

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:53.110
Exactly.

00:10:53.530 --> 00:10:55.770
I also used oil out of pig back
which was pickled in red oil.

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:56.970
Then I wrapped it inside.

00:10:57.620 --> 00:10:58.930
It would melt when fried.

00:10:59.030 --> 00:11:00.750
And it would immerse in the wrapper completely.

00:11:00.980 --> 00:11:02.250
Since then,

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:03.130
spicy flavour of red oil sauce

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:04.540
came out.

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:06.210
Yes.

00:11:06.380 --> 00:11:08.420
So it melted when the dumpling was fried well,

00:11:08.470 --> 00:11:09.400
right?

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:11.020
At first sight,

00:11:11.070 --> 00:11:13.050
These fried dumplings have nothing special.

00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:15.110
Actually it takes great effort

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:17.450
which makes the dumplings worth chewing over.

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:20.960
I didn't expect fried dumplings

00:11:21.390 --> 00:11:23.020
can be so delicious.

00:11:23.150 --> 00:11:25.450
I have never tasted such flavour before.

00:11:26.310 --> 00:11:28.020
Who is this guy?

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:37.020
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:40.250
It's really good. Thank you very much.

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:41.130
Kid,

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:43.910
you really have a good taste of cuisine.

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:46.070
You're the one who really have a good taste.

00:11:47.980 --> 00:11:50.690
Well, can I have one more plate?

00:11:51.070 --> 00:11:52.920
Sure. Please help yourself.

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:55.480
We're really happy to hear you say that!

00:11:55.620 --> 00:11:56.520
Here you are.

00:11:56.570 --> 00:11:58.670
No, I can't eat so much.

00:12:00.880 --> 00:12:03.100
Since that old man is hungry,

00:12:03.470 --> 00:12:04.370
what does it matter that

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:05.060
you give him more,

00:12:05.110 --> 00:12:05.770
Mao?

00:12:06.260 --> 00:12:06.850
Takeo,

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:08.490
why are you here?

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:13.410
The famous Yang Spring Restaurant in Guangzhou

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:14.820
should have no guest.

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:15.780
So poor.

00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:18.130
But it's not your fault.

00:12:18.360 --> 00:12:19.230
All these should be blamed on

00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:21.630
Chef Zhou Yu who gets injured at such a crucial time.

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:23.120
What are you saying?

00:12:25.020 --> 00:12:25.810
Chef Zhou Yu,

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:27.310
don't mind it.

00:12:29.270 --> 00:12:31.040
Let's have a competition on our cooking skills.

00:12:32.190 --> 00:12:33.010
The result

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:34.140
has been clear for some time.

00:12:34.340 --> 00:12:36.140
See our plates.

00:12:40.680 --> 00:12:41.740
So, so many plates.

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:42.180
Well,

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:44.280
you just feed these dumplings

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:45.830
to this old man.

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:47.290
He'll offer you some plates.

00:12:49.440 --> 00:12:50.110
What's up?

00:12:52.050 --> 00:12:53.870
Why do officers come here?

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:57.120
What? They come so quickly.

00:13:00.720 --> 00:13:02.980
Well, you come here and have a taste.

00:13:03.110 --> 00:13:03.670
It's great.

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:05.390
Guangdong Proconsular charged us again and again

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:08.200
to keep you safe.

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:10.070
It bothers us a lot that

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:11.790
you wander around.

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:13.120
Master Lang Wen.

00:13:19.160 --> 00:13:20.660
Are you Master Lang Wen?

00:13:20.930 --> 00:13:22.850
Why do you come here in person?

00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:25.590
Elder Guan of Guangzhou Cook League also...

00:13:25.710 --> 00:13:26.610
Chef Zhou Yu,

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:28.540
who is this old man?

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:30.290
He's the chef in charge of Imperial Buttery

00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:31.140
earlier than

00:13:31.170 --> 00:13:33.110
Provincial Military Commander Li.

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:35.590
And he is the legendary authority of cuisine,

00:13:36.180 --> 00:13:37.110
Master Lang Wen.

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:41.510
Nobody knows where he is after he resigned.

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:42.630
It's said that he is wandering around the country

00:13:42.740 --> 00:13:43.910
to find

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:45.680
brilliant cooks and cuisine,

00:13:45.730 --> 00:13:47.220
and enjoy food.

00:13:49.230 --> 00:13:51.830
I didn't expect to meet him here.

00:13:58.530 --> 00:14:00.320
Are you Takeo?

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:02.330
Have you ever thought what are foodies

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:05.930
really looking for?

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:11.500
I said to you that
I wanted one more plate at that time,

00:14:11.550 --> 00:14:13.040
not because I was hungry

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:14.330
but for your cuisine

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:15.130
which is as delicious as Mao's.

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:16.650
It's really nice.

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:18.480
But you refused.

00:14:18.660 --> 00:14:21.320
I'm sorry for you.

00:14:21.390 --> 00:14:22.550
It's really pitiful.

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:26.860
To be honest,

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:28.810
your problem is not cooking skill,

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:31.110
but moral quality.

00:14:39.760 --> 00:14:41.340
Hey, let's go to the Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:42.420
The legendary master

00:14:42.470 --> 00:14:43.810
also speaks highly of it.

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:44.810
It's Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:47.070
Let's try their fried dumplings.

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:58.630
Take care. There're many guests.

00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:03.110
It's really nice.

00:15:03.410 --> 00:15:05.090
Yes, it's great.

00:15:05.140 --> 00:15:06.050
Can I have one more plate?

00:15:06.650 --> 00:15:08.640
All right, let's go up!

00:15:24.710 --> 00:15:26.340
I want one more plate.

00:15:27.490 --> 00:15:29.240
Well, the ritual Guangzhou Dumpling Competition

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:30.980
held in the Spring Festival

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:33.530
is nearly over.

00:15:33.690 --> 00:15:35.100
Now Yang Spring Restaurant

00:15:35.150 --> 00:15:36.400
has replaced Dumpling Brothers

00:15:36.520 --> 00:15:39.080
who were far ahead before.

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:40.350
And they are accumulating plates at an incredible speed.

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:43.810
Well, sorry to keep you waiting.

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:47.890
It looks good.

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:49.640
I had no idea Mao can do it so well.

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:52.500
Our Chef Zhou Yu really has a vision.

00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:55.130
Don't worry.

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:56.400
They won't catch up with us.

00:15:58.800 --> 00:16:00.820
It's hard to say

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:02.540
who will win the competition.

00:16:02.930 --> 00:16:03.990
In the first half,

00:16:04.030 --> 00:16:05.390
Dumpling Brothers had the absolute advantage.

00:16:05.550 --> 00:16:07.130
While for the high ratings

00:16:07.180 --> 00:16:10.740
from legendary Master Lang Wen,

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:12.450
the talented cook from Yang Spring Restaurant

00:16:12.500 --> 00:16:14.420
stands out.

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:15.470
His fried dumplings

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:16.470
are also one of champion candidates.

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:17.560
The clock is ticking.

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:19.060
Sun of destiny

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:21.290
is going to set into western sky.

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:23.990
Finally,

00:16:24.140 --> 00:16:25.900
sun of destiny finally

00:16:26.020 --> 00:16:29.970
sets into western sky.

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:34.010
Now plates as the basis for evaluation

00:16:34.060 --> 00:16:35.610
will be taken out from competitors

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:38.210
and sent to the Statistics Department of the competition

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:40.340
in the back of judge's bench

00:16:40.490 --> 00:16:44.640
under strict guard.

00:16:45.050 --> 00:16:46.870
All the results here

00:16:46.990 --> 00:16:47.890
will be recorded directly.

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:49.040
After sealed,

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:52.200
they will be sent to judges on the bench.

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:57.040
Then the final champion

00:16:57.220 --> 00:16:58.130
will be announced

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:00.070
on the stage there soon afterward.

00:17:00.390 --> 00:17:01.650
There's a stately door of destiny

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:03.100
on the stage.

00:17:03.280 --> 00:17:04.840
All the plates counted

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:07.240
will choose the champion out in front of you.

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:09.550
Please wait and see.

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:12.470
I'm so tired.

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:14.290
But we've tried our best,

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:15.090
right?

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:17.460
What Chef Zhou Yu said is right.

00:17:17.650 --> 00:17:18.980
If our dumplings are good enough,

00:17:19.030 --> 00:17:20.240
guests must come and have a try,

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:21.120
right?

00:17:21.410 --> 00:17:22.500
Yes.

00:17:25.150 --> 00:17:26.890
At least we're the winner

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:29.530
although the Master Lang Wen appeared unexpectedly.

00:17:30.580 --> 00:17:31.240
Takeo,

00:17:32.310 --> 00:17:33.530
what is more important

00:17:34.480 --> 00:17:36.050
and unexpected

00:17:36.520 --> 00:17:38.150
is the ability of that kid.

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:43.960
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:45.700
everyone who purposely comes here

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:47.140
to take part in

00:17:47.190 --> 00:17:48.910
the annual dumpling competition.

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:49.590
Thank you

00:17:49.640 --> 00:17:51.540
for waiting.

00:17:51.790 --> 00:17:53.660
We had the results of the competition

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:54.530
just now.

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:56.780
I'll reveal it immediately.

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:03.830
Now allow me to announce

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:05.860
the first finalist,

00:18:11.970 --> 00:18:15.180
Beiyuan Restaurant, 124 plates.

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:16.720
We'll lose.

00:18:16.810 --> 00:18:17.790
There's no hope at all.

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:19.770
It's less than half the plates last year.

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:22.140
And next,

00:18:25.430 --> 00:18:28.100
Taotao Garden, 184 plates.

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:32.060
What? Oh my god!

00:18:32.930 --> 00:18:34.220
It's a shame.

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:35.890
Let's continue.

00:18:36.110 --> 00:18:38.570
Guangzhou Dumpling Restaurant, the champion last year,

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:44.210
three plates.

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:46.020
Hurry up! Who's next?

00:18:46.130 --> 00:18:47.460
Next! Be quick!

00:18:48.950 --> 00:18:51.200
Now remember, Dumpling Brothers.

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:53.940
Many restaurants get unexpectedly bad results this year.

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:56.080
Strong rival last year

00:18:56.220 --> 00:18:57.540
should have such a poor score.

00:18:58.020 --> 00:19:00.480
Bancai Restaurant, 82 plates.

00:19:02.630 --> 00:19:03.550
I hope our Yang Spring Restaurant

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:04.510
can have a better result.

00:19:04.980 --> 00:19:06.630
Well, from the current result,

00:19:06.680 --> 00:19:07.910
I think you all know

00:19:08.020 --> 00:19:08.990
it seems that there's a typhoon

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:10.370
appearing in the competition this year.

00:19:10.950 --> 00:19:12.160
The next restaurant

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:13.330
gets too many plates

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:15.030
to carry

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:16.280
onto the stage.

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:18.700
Please watch it out.

00:19:20.820 --> 00:19:22.880
There are so many plates that
only the elephant can pull it.

00:19:23.280 --> 00:19:25.690
The next is the highly visible Dumpling Brothers.

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:32.940
There are 1242 plates.

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:35.960
Such an amazing number.

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:38.760
They set a new record

00:19:38.850 --> 00:19:41.580
of our competition.

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:43.570
Mao.

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:46.940
We have only one restaurant left.

00:19:47.770 --> 00:19:49.710
Yang Spring Restaurant has...

00:19:57.640 --> 00:19:59.620
There should be another elephant.

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:02.950
Yang Spring Restaurant has

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:09.280
1242 plates.

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:11.330
1242 plates.

00:20:11.450 --> 00:20:12.640
They get the same number,

00:20:15.350 --> 00:20:17.230
and they both set a new record for our competition.

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:20.100
Yang Spring Restaurant

00:20:20.220 --> 00:20:21.820
and Dumpling Brothers top the list together.

00:20:21.940 --> 00:20:23.840
How could it be? We should have the same score.

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:25.330
Same score?

00:20:25.760 --> 00:20:26.640
We just need one more.

00:20:26.690 --> 00:20:28.050
Is it left somewhere?

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:31.560
Hey, what is Guangzhou Cook League going to do?

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:32.810
Make it clear.

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:35.490
Are they both champions?

00:20:40.540 --> 00:20:41.350
It's awful.

00:20:41.450 --> 00:20:43.240
We haven't ever met such situation before.

00:20:43.890 --> 00:20:45.770
They just need to compete
with each other one more time.

00:20:46.990 --> 00:20:48.010
I hope you don't mind that

00:20:48.060 --> 00:20:50.680
I interfere with the competition

00:20:50.730 --> 00:20:51.920
held by Guangzhou Cook League.

00:20:52.490 --> 00:20:53.490
Elder Guan,

00:20:54.760 --> 00:20:56.120
if it's decided upon

00:20:56.170 --> 00:20:58.090
subjective opinions,

00:20:58.140 --> 00:20:59.870
guests won't be convinced.

00:21:00.300 --> 00:21:01.940
What's more, I want to eat

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:03.960
their dumplings again.

00:21:04.470 --> 00:21:05.170
What do you think?

00:21:05.220 --> 00:21:07.010
What about you guys?

00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:09.670
Yes.

00:21:10.650 --> 00:21:11.810
It's a deal.

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:16.690
Well, tomorrow

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:20.000
Yang Spring Restaurant and Dumpling Brothers

00:21:20.150 --> 00:21:22.250
will have a competition here again.

00:21:22.410 --> 00:21:23.470
Okay.

00:21:23.610 --> 00:21:24.600
Wait.

00:21:28.000 --> 00:21:30.540
I want you to make some different dumplings

00:21:30.590 --> 00:21:32.520
for the final competition, OK?

00:21:35.090 --> 00:21:35.590
Don't get me wrong.

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:37.090
I just feel bored

00:21:37.140 --> 00:21:38.370
to eat the same things.

00:21:38.950 --> 00:21:40.020
It's just my thought.

00:21:40.490 --> 00:21:42.150
I see. I'll take this challenge.

00:21:42.300 --> 00:21:43.730
So will I.

00:23:14.970 --> 00:23:18.293
Preview of the next episode

00:23:18.293 --> 00:23:21.607
Now it's time for the final round of
the dumpling competition.

00:23:21.733 --> 00:23:24.153
What the Dumpling Brothers brought out
with all their strength

00:23:24.153 --> 00:23:27.947
was a tremendous, undefeatable dragon dumpling.

00:23:28.440 --> 00:23:30.120
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:30.120 --> 00:23:32.452
Confrontation, Dragon Dumpling

00:23:32.452 --> 00:23:33.870
It will definitely be interesting!
